e; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/71c1d/3.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"3\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/f058b/3.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/c26ae/3.png 158w,\n/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/6bdcf/3.png 315w,\n/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/f058b/3.png 630w,\n/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/40601/3.png 945w,\n/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/78612/3.png 1260w,\n/static/a9c6a2041750f3f8da04d37b6935e1f1/71c1d/3.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>(아마도) 토르랑 같이 찍은 사진</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/71c1d/4.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"4\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/f058b/4.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/c26ae/4.png 158w,\n/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/6bdcf/4.png 315w,\n/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/f058b/4.png 630w,\n/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/40601/4.png 945w,\n/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/78612/4.png 1260w,\n/static/d07eb288d033f360b26236d36bb24ddf/71c1d/4.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li>점박이가 매력적인 루이</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/71c1d/img.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"img.png\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/f058b/img.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/c26ae/img.png 158w,\n/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/6bdcf/img.png 315w,\n/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/f058b/img.png 630w,\n/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/40601/img.png 945w,\n/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/78612/img.png 1260w,\n/static/f34cedccac5c80f6d217d9753dff061c/71c1d/img.png 1536w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>이 날 할 일이 꽤 많고 아이들도 볕이 따뜻한 탓인지 사람이 많은 탓인지 잘 나오지 않아 사진을 많이 못찍었다.<br>\n토르랑 야외 산책도 나갔는데 주민 분들도 많이 오가고 대형견들을 단체로 산책하다보니 집중해야해서 사진 찍을 여력이 없었다.</p>\n<p>오랜만에 간 보호센터에는 자주 보이던 친구들이 많이 보이지 않았다.<br>\n특히 내 최애였던 동동이는 인스타를 통해 해외로 입양 간 사실을 알고 있었지만, 내심 아쉬웠다 ㅜ<br>\n그래도 아이들한테는 더 나은 세상을 살고 있다는 뜻이니까 너무너무 다행이다.<br>\n남은 아이들도 모두 좋은 곳으로 입양갔으면 좋겠다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"정봉-티셔츠\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EB%B4%89-%ED%8B%B0%EC%85%94%EC%B8%A0\" aria-label=\"정봉 티셔츠 permalink\" class=\"anchor-header before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.65 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정봉 티셔츠</h2>\n<p>모든 봉사활동이 끝나고 마무리하는 중에 현장 관리자 님께서 정봉티를 챙겨주셨다!<br>\n봉사를 3회차 이상 온 사람들을 <strong>정봉</strong>이라고 부르는데, 정봉들에게 나눠주는 티셔츠이다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/21b4d/t_shirt.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"3회 차 방문 기념으로 받은 티셔츠!\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/f058b/t_shirt.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/c26ae/t_shirt.png 158w,\n/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/6bdcf/t_shirt.png 315w,\n/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/f058b/t_shirt.png 630w,\n/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/40601/t_shirt.png 945w,\n/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/78612/t_shirt.png 1260w,\n/static/d8cc891f4ae0595684663584550e8757/21b4d/t_shirt.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>직접 입어보니 생각보다 티셔치가 쫀쫀하고 페인팅도 너무 이뻤다.<br>\n너무 감사합니다 ☺️</p>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%B4%89%EC%82%AC-%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%84\">봉사 사진</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EB%B4%89-%ED%8B%B0%EC%85%94%EC%B8%A0\">정봉 티셔츠</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"유기견 보호센터 자원봉사 3회 차 후기!","date":"2026년 3월 23일","dateISO":"2026-03-23","description":"오랜만에 유기견 보호센터 자원봉사를 다녀온 후기입니다.","tags":["유기견 보호센터 자원봉사","포해피니스"]}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/posts/longest-palindromic-substring/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[알고리즘 오답노트] LeetCode - Longest Palindromic Substring"}},"next":null},"pageContext":{"id":"e4db9053-0ce3-5ea3-987b-f5c9c895e9f8","previousPostId":"0d815753-9528-5f78-b386-e582d5c1c06b","nextPostId":null}},"staticQueryHashes":["2637872971","3361002528","3414707483"],"slicesMap":{}}